    ⟨.mul (.mul (.mul (.mul (.mul (.mul (.mul (.named .h0) (.named .h0))
      (.named .h0)) (.named .h0)) (.named .h0)) (.named .h0)) (.named .h0))
      (.mul (.named .h5) (.named .h5)),0⟩ (by decide)
